# cmake options of CUPDAQ V4.3.1, read by recipes/CUPDAQ/build.sh (one per line; '#' starts a comment).
# The install prefix is added by build.sh. ROOT, HDF5 and CUPDATAMODEL come from the modulefiles of the recipe's
# depends; libusb, yaml-cpp and zeromq from the system (packages group daq).
#
-DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release
# never let cmake call dnf or apt
-DCUPDAQ_AUTO_INSTALL_DEPENDENCIES=OFF
